t=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FZuP90v9yuUQ7kNvwGLiP9m&_nc_oc=AdogRuHK88pOIF8-L8EbQVvn22wTZCQwGvgsGLnIXCtzhMa9Uzw8bmRfG--XZRuKWRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPKuWnlrtYwiX5SoQSh8aKSO0r1iPbR_qQKNOcIpZPFvg&oe=6ADE2907"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1512781303346635", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1512781306679968_8311265691607344888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rPWPf6_A7FIQ7kNvwH6tXlz&_nc_oc=AdpQZf4xqvMJQrOjEgzpNiFAe1vvjmfnDYMfkdq44ZTiNXtqMd8b8wzj6U41pdtaK04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsXHknAttjLvLmkp21G1mvFpi985frxxAlA8WuIjg1OQ&oe=6ADE068D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 copy.png", "id": "4351475101785831", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_4351475105119164_1853464437308931599_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9Ui1tGqUe5kQ7kNvwFyuTpD&_nc_oc=Ado8sR5PGyX1CcespXbsEXRYKX79M5WyQsee3wL7AM4Ag4sFz74kYwZQ6eHBJ8V5BfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOoB2lLpF4kSDt3pyZwsBdGg0KfaC69SCrhoKr1O2hdgw&oe=6ADDF7F8"}, "display_name": "PutterVR", "keywords": ["golf"], "long_description": "# Lower Your Scores From Your Living Room\n**Free to try for 3 days.** Everything unlocked. Then one in-app purchase to keep playing. No subscription.\n\n**Three ways to play:**\n- **Launch Monitor:** putt a real ball - we read its true speed and line, then roll it out on a replica green with real break. Nothing to attach. Requires a putting mat or similar surface.\n- **Mixed Reality:** putt a virtual ball while still seeing your room and your feet (optional mount).\n- **Virtual Reality:** full immersion (optional mount).\n\nThe optional mount puts your controller on your own putter so the stroke is measured too.\n\n**Drills with a purpose.** Distance control, start line, aim, setup, pressure putting.\n\n**Championship courses.** 72 replica holes on greens from the courses the pros compete on every week.\n\n**Physics you can trust.** Tens of thousands of real ball data points - authentic skid, roll, break, and lip-outs. Dial in stimp to match your course.\n\n**Tour-level analytics.** Ball speed, line and miss patterns. Add the mount for face angle, path, tempo, smash factor and impact heat maps. In-headset, web, or mobile.\n\n**Every training aid built in.** Putting arc, alignment laser, tempo line, metronome, putting mirror, tee gates.\n\n**Play a friend.** 1v1 rounds and mini games over ranked multiplayer.\n\n**One price.** No pass, no season ticket, no renewals.\n\nQuestions? Chat with the dev team: https://discord.gg/2SbUnnpCfx", "short_description": "Real putter, real ball, every stroke measured. Putting practice on Meta Quest 3 with no subscription."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "3543613075811708", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_3543613082478374_638908712768740982_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VK6h3O2PTTQQ7kNvwGc2znE&_nc_oc=AdpTWrxWaVndycZNJCJxiIAy7eY_TStTIS0kKqVooOIzU9Txjf9ziJaYkS4Qw93JI64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOrGyeanLoXHL2yEIN5bF-bVYnfwcU4xKSW_9hrXxZkUA&oe=6ADE0FBA"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 2560x1440.png", "id": "2026406291329707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_2026406294663040_7189430179496047163_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mSha92Zia_QQ7kNvwGFC-Ua&_nc_oc=AdrFhYK9LIo0NVAiU9g4AIWLn5yxYM6zAI-F0Nu6mxAtKz70hZeuwcq6ZEosDZM2xqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNB7MXn9Snc0KY3REnvE_yJkRuoF9CSO7RmUW4D4lZf4A&oe=6ADE2350"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 1008x1440.png", "id": "1568265651414352", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc